+# Python Web Starter
+
+A minimal Flask app with a home page and a health check endpoint.
+
+## Run locally
+
+```bash
+python -m venv .venv
+source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\\Scripts\\activate
+pip install -r requirements.txt
+python app.py
+```
+
+Open http://127.0.0.1:5000. The `/health` endpoint returns `{"status":"ok"}`.
